    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a classic puzzle game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of this game is to push all the boxes to the target position with as few steps as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The box can only be pushed, not pulled. Only one box can be pushed at a time. Be careful not to push the box into blind spots, otherwise it won't be able to be pushed any further. The rules of this game are simple, but very difficult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses four wasd buttons to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to move their characters within a limited space to push the wooden crate to a designated location. The game tests players' spatial planning and strategic planning abilities, as improper operation may result in boxes being unable to move or passages being blocked.</p>",
